<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CJ Lawrence cuts AT&amp;T.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CJ Lawrence cuts AT&amp;T.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CJ Lawrence said it lowered its recommendation on AT&amp;T Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Stuart Conrad was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 3/4 to 50-3/4 in midsession New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
